te e bigotto del pastore aveva fatto subito desistere i possibili pretendenti, ma il loro ricordo è rimasto indelebile in alcuni di loro.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Passioni artistiche, sensuali e sacre si uniscono nel Banchetto di Babette.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"1987-08-11","status":"Released","rating":7.2,"ratingCount":460,"genres":["Dramma","Storia","Commedia"],"countries":["Denmark"],"facts":{"Runtime":"104m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":19092,"name":"Stéphane Audran","role":"Babette","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wRuDncFfkDKYWctwJGiqkvXBz3i.jpg"},{"id":70635,"name":"Bodil Kjer","role":"Filippa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pcsl3aVTOvkLMKp8HeeHfzOJik6.jpg"},{"id":47155,"name":"Birgitte Federspiel","role":"Martine","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kloY23KHUdqDt83uXTaqDRJUwwH.jpg"},{"id":1022633,"name":"Jarl Kulle","role":"General Lorens Löwenhielm","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9UJ3Msw0k0fkV5vQiRqG3j4Pfq9.jpg"},{"id":1429989,"name":"Jean-Philippe Lafont","role":"Achille Papin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cD2ZEPdR7IwqOFqhaHGFmppRb6k.jpg"},{"id":6657,"name":"Bibi Andersson","role":"Svensk hofdame","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6EGqmWOR3R3jv3IgrEZmCjTAVGv.jpg"},{"id":47153,"name":"Ghita Nørby","role":"Fortæller (stemme)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5tjiG18hPmUOzy2PFnxcq5fkbxh.jpg"},{"id":1114530,"name":"Asta Esper Hagen Andersen","role":"Anna","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7lC6g1Fd3G3f91PX0isgE9ucM2R.jpg"},{"id":1116664,"name":"Thomas Antoni","role":"Svensk Løjtnant"},{"id":1429988,"name":"Hanne Stensgaard","role":"Filippa som ung","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9qIeUqQKoZHdvsZux0CTPWl8Fba.jpg"},{"id":202575,"name":"Vibeke Hastrup","role":"Martine som ung","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wiDwjVEBeFBBeZSTJ6wjo3huzwv.jpg"},{"id":1429990,"name":"